  (text "JACK BOARD  (3 x NJ6FD-V ~24 mm under the panel; 10-way IDC ribbon to CN3 on the main board)"
    (at 30.48 31.75 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid d86c87a6-adec-574d-b1bc-31339968e618)
  )
  (text "J1 line in: its normals put tip and ring on GNDA when nothing is plugged in (the 1M bias would hiss otherwise);"
    (at 106.68 125.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid c907b39d-3f8d-5a7e-9585-4baf2eefab1e)
  )
  (text "   C8 / C9 are the RF shunts at the jack." (at 106.68 128.524 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2b29dbdf-f042-55be-9ee0-2820ffec5c2c)
  )
  (text "J2 insert: tip = send, ring = return; unplugged, the ring normal puts the send on the return."
    (at 106.68 131.318 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid cd3eb468-9b0c-5a10-b12a-ac323504da1e)
  )
  (text "Sleeves: the balanced jacks (J1, J5) on CHASSIS, bonded to the panel through the plated standoffs H1 / H2,"
    (at 106.68 134.112 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 4707a9ad-e378-5a55-b0fb-46c212151bd3)
  )
  (text "   so cable-shield currents stay out of GNDA; the insert (single-ended) keeps GNDA."
    (at 106.68 136.906 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid b0a2b4d6-6afc-54b6-85d6-36ddf6f02649)
  )

